-- a constructor's telescope (at fresh parameters): how many fields, and which are recursive, in
-- order; a codata type's fields of the type itself. What programs over codes read of a data type
-- (lib/std.cub gives them their types)
tel-nfields tel = case tel of tx A nm r → %wsucc (tel-nfields (r (%var Uw) Uw)); _ → #0
